{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02816","headline":"送郑司仓入蜀 · 卢照邻","name":"送郑司仓入蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离人丹水北，游客锦城东。\n别意还无已，离忧自不穷。\n陇云朝结阵，江月夜临空。\n关塞疲征马，霜氛落早鸿。\n潘年三十外，蜀道五千中。\n送君秋水曲，酌酒对清风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}